### Lisan AI Service — Manual Testing
### استخدم REST Client extension في VS Code
### اضغط "Send Request" على كل واحد

@base_url = http://localhost:8000
@secret = lisan-dev-secret-2026

###################################
# 1️⃣ BASIC TESTS
###################################

### 1.1 Health Check
GET {{base_url}}/api/ai/health

### 1.2 Greeting (Router Hit)
POST {{base_url}}/api/ai/chat
X-Internal-Service-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "שלום",
  "level": "A1"
}

###################################
# 2️⃣ CANONICAL CACHE TESTS
###################################

### 2.1 Word Meaning - Arabic Phrasing (First Request)
POST {{base_url}}/api/ai/chat
X-Internal-Service-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "שו יעני בית",
  "level": "A1",
  "includeArabic": true
}

### 2.2 Word Meaning - Hebrew Phrasing (Cache Hit Expected)
POST {{base_url}}/api/ai/chat
X-Internal-Service-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "מה זה בית",
  "level": "A1"
}

### 2.3 Different Word (Not Cache Hit)
POST {{base_url}}/api/ai/chat
X-Internal-Service-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "מה זה אבא",
  "level": "A1"
}

###################################
# 3️⃣ OUT-OF-SCOPE TESTS
###################################

### 3.1 Blocked Topic - בורסה (Stocks)
POST {{base_url}}/api/ai/chat
X-Internal-Service-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "בורסה",
  "level": "A1"
}

### 3.2 Blocked Topic - קריפטו (Crypto)
POST {{base_url}}/api/ai/chat
